title: "Systematic divergence between modeled and notified syphilis burden, China, 2004-2025: data and code"
abstract: >-
  Parallel-series triangulation of GBD 2023 modelled syphilis burden against three official
  Chinese notification series (onset date, final-review date, report date), with the fifteen
  machine-readable datasets, the analysis code and figures 1-5 of the manuscript.
